      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Immaculate 3-Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence on the Outskirts of Tralee\r\nThis 3-bedroom semi-detached home is conveniently located on the outskirts of Tralee, close to a wide range of local amenities. Ideally positioned within easy reach of the town centre, University Hospital Kerry, and shopping facilities, this property offers both comfort and convenience.\r\nThe property is maintained to a very good condition throughout and offers bright, comfortable living space, ideal for family living. Excellent transport links include the N70 to Milltown and the N69 to Listowel, with easy access to Munster Technological University and Astellas Pharmaceutical. Nature enthusiasts will enjoy the nearby Ballyseedy Woods, perfect for scenic walks and outdoor activities. Additionally, the property is in close proximity to Mitchel's GAA Club. Combining comfort, practicality and location, this residence is an ideal choice for families and  alike seeking a move-in-ready home in Tralee."
      },
